\citation{bellec2020solution}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {End-to-End SPWM Architecture.} Four-stage dataflow: (1) \textit  {Perceptual Bottleneck}: Dual event-camera streams $\mathbf  {E}_t \in \{0, 1\}^{B \times 4 \times 32 \times 32}$ processed via Conv2D + residual wrist fusion ($\mathbf  {F}_t \in \mathbb  {R}^{B \times 16 \times 8 \times 8}$) and SpatialSoftmax ($\tau = 1.0$) extracting topological keypoints $\mathbf  {k}_t \in [-1, 1]^{32}$ and visual embedding $\mathbf  {x}_t \in \mathbb  {R}^{128}$ ($15{,}904$ params); (2) \textit  {Recurrent Spiking Dynamics}: Predictive coding error $\boldsymbol  {\epsilon }_t = \mathbf  {x}_t - \mathbf  {W}_{\text  {sens}}\mathbf  {z}_{t-1}$ ($16{,}384$ params) and motor action $\mathbf  {u}_t$ driving a two-tier ALIF core ($N=256$, reactive pool $\beta _1=0.90$ and deep pool $\beta _2=0.985$) with firing-rate homeostasis, producing spikes $\mathbf  {s}_t \in \{0,1\}^{256}$ and membrane states $\mathbf  {V}_t \in \mathbb  {R}^{256}$; (3) \textit  {Phase-Space Partitioning}: LayerNorm fusion into $\mathbf  {p}_{t} \in \mathbb  {R}^{96}$ and direct velocity slicing $\mathbf  {v}_p = \mathbf  {p}_{t}[..., :32]$ into $\mathbf  {q}_{t} \in \mathbb  {R}^{32}$ regulated by the Anti-Evanescence Stasis Gate $K_{\text  {gate}}$ ($117{,}312$ active params); (4) \textit  {Predictor \& Decoder}: Action-conditioned dissipative surrogate $M_1$ ($158{,}944$ params) and zero-lag kinematic decoder ($9{,}356$ params) feeding Differentiable Forward Kinematics (FK) and Residual-Gated Sensory Handover (Eq.~\ref {eq:handover}).}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{5}{}{figure.1}{}}
